*> Test of 29a section 6, Bubble columns (core/src/fluids-29a-b.cob; T0489): the scheduling of the column check, the column state, the surface test and the velocity changes with their caps, skips and particle rounds.
*> A case loads its inputs from a text of numbers (LOAD-IN fills WS-I as integers and WS-FX as doubles), calls the program
*> and shows the outputs WS-R(1..WS-N) joined by "/", one group per call; expected values come from the rules and tables of the section.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-FLUIDS-29A-6.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
